{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-torino","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"torino-oro24-real-estate-developments-arjan","about":"Torino is a luxury residential development located in the Arjan neighbourhood of Dubai. The project has been developed by Oro 24 Developments.The complex consists of six 5-storey buildings with a large courtyard and includes studios and 1-2 bedroom apartments. The residences are designed to offer the maximum level of comfort to all residents. All units are partially furnished with fitted wardrobes and kitchen appliances.The complex provides a wide range of facilities and services including: covered parking, badminton court, barbecue area, children's playground and swimming pool, gazebos, health club, jogging tracks, outdoor cinema, event space, petting zoo, squash court, swimming pool and water slide, yoga area, central air conditioning, 24-hour security and concierge services.The complex is conveniently located in the centre of Dubai, in close proximity to two motorways and the popular Umm Suqeim road, making it quite easy to get around the city. The infrastructure of the neighbourhood is excellent, with several international educational institutions and hospitals, with many shops, pharmacies, cafes and restaurants within walking distance.There are many popular attractions close to the complex, including: Dubai Miracle Garden and Dubai Butterfly Garden, as well as Mall of the Emirates. Dubai International Airport is a 25-minute drive away.","price":595000,"title":"Torino","bitrix":{"id":708,"pf_id":"are.2.11740","source":null,"project_id":"Torino","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Torino","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"ORO24","project_location":"Arjan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2384/images/2024/06/28/340x252/OSAe4cXgj64gstzIBpLbMb4RIqwkqg5GxfBn5nfa.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpj